  ultimateText: "Thanh Long Hi\u1EC7n: h\u1ED3n r\u1ED3ng l\u1EE5c lao d\u1ECDc lane
    xuy\xEAn m\u1ECDi qu\xE1i, s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng \xD75 + th\xEAm theo m\xE1u
    \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t; m\u1ED7i qu\xE1i b\u1ECB h\u1EA1 ho\xE0n 10% mana."
  passiveText: "K\u1EBFt Ngh\u0129a (nh\u01B0 L\u01B0u B\u1ECB). V\xF5 Th\xE1nh:
    \u0111\xF2n th\u01B0\u1EDDng ch\xE9m qu\u1EA1t tr\xFAng t\u1EDBi 3 qu\xE1i; m\u1ED7i
    qu\xE1i b\u1ECB h\u1EA1 +1 t\u1EA7ng Uy (+5% c\xF4ng, +2% h\xFAt m\xE1u, t\u1ED1i
    \u0111a 6, m\u1EA5t khi h\u1EBFt wave)."
  minorText: "Thanh Long Y\u1EC3n Nguy\u1EC7t: s\xF3ng \u0111ao tr\u0103ng khuy\u1EBFt
    bay d\u1ECDc lane, xuy\xEAn qu\xE1i, \xD72 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  secondMinorText: "Th\xE1c \u0110ao K\u1EBF: m\xE1u d\u01B0\u1EDBi 40% \u2192 l\xF9i
    1 \xF4 gi\u1EA3 thua r\u1ED3i quay l\u1EA1i ch\xE9m \xD73 v\xE0o qu\xE1i \u0111u\u1ED5i
    theo (1 l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i wave)."
